{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14215","headline":"抚州处士湖泛舟送北回两指此南昌县查溪兰若别 · 戎昱","name":"抚州处士湖泛舟送北回两指此南昌县查溪兰若别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移樽铺山曲，祖帐查溪阴。\n铺山即远道，查溪非故林。\n凄然诵新诗，落泪沾素襟。\n郡政我何有，别情君独深。\n禅庭古树秋，宿雨清沈沈。\n挥袂故里远，悲伤去住心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}